    "60 property types, both periods, transcribed 2026-09-05 from the owner-supplied text of 1 RCNY §103-14(c).",
    "VERIFY 1 — 'Distribution Center' 2024–2029 = 0.00574: the label was lost in the 2024–2029 paste and was recovered from the 2030–2034 list, where it is the only type between 'Data Center' and 'Enclosed Mall'. Both lists have 60 rows in the same order. Confirm against the rule text.",
    "VERIFY 2 — 'Laboratory' is the only type whose 2030–2034 limit (0.026029868) is HIGHER than its 2024–2029 limit (0.02381). Every other type tightens. Transcribed verbatim; confirm against the rule text. The integrity golden carries an explicit allow-list for this row.",
    "2030–2034 values were pasted as a block of 51 labels followed by 51 values; they were paired by position. Anchor check: 'Multifamily Housing' lands on 0.003346640, the value independently known from spec Rev 1.",
    "The ten distinct 2024–2029 values are exactly the ten statutory occupancy-group values of §28-320.3.1 — DOB mapped ESPM types onto the statutory set. The 2030–2034 values follow a different methodology and are type-specific.",
    "`Other` and `Mixed Use` are excluded by rule; the `Other - …` sub-types below are valid ESPM types with their own limits.",
    "sourceSha256 to be filled by `pnpm audit:rulesets` once the canonical PDF is pinned."
